  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0: writes are all or nothing and made one at a time; a transaction belongs to the code that began it, and other threads wait for it; a key part at its type's default, and a property or collection type XOD can't store, are refused; a parent's update writes its children and its Cascade = Update relations only. Fixes to relations, cascade deletes, crash recovery and password-protected writes. Read https://xod.sabaeon.com/docs/upgrading before upgrading. All notes: https://github.com/mhsallam/xod/blob/main/docs/RELEASE-NOTES-2.1.0.md. XOD 2.0: a rework of the 2017 library. Versions before 2.0.0 (0.1.x and the 1.0.0 betas) were MIT; 2.0.0 is Apache-2.0. Migration guide from 1.x: https://github.com/mhsallam/xod/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION-GUIDE.md",
